KerasHub Gemma 4 31B Instruct on Kaggle TPU v5e-8

This source distribution does not include model weights.

The reference runtime documented in docs/qualification.md was qualified on
Kaggle TPU v5e-8 with eight TPU devices, mesh [1,8] and bfloat16 compute, using
Keras 3.15.1, KerasHub 0.32.0, JAX 0.10.2, JAXLIB 0.10.2 and libtpu 0.0.49.

Qualification is scoped to that runtime version set and workload. It is not a
guarantee for other accelerators, other dependency versions, or different prompt
lengths, bucket sizes and modalities. The recorded measurements are published in
evidence/qualification.json.
